  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Multi-Partner Fund (TF No. 072600, parallel account to the original account TF No. 072283)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The principal objective of the World Bank Multi Partner Fund (MPF) is to provide a platform for coordinated financing for the sustainable reconstruction and development of Somalia. As envisioned by the Somali Compact, the World Bank Trust Fund under the Somalia Reconstruction and Development Fund (SDRF) has been set up with a focus on core state functions and socio-economic recovery.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
